msgctxt "168"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san. You're back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"So, will you play golf with the president? We'll pay for the round, of "
"course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "Sorry... You'll have to find somebody else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Oh... All right. I'm sorry for bothering you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Once the president requests something, I must do as he says. If you change "
"your mind, come talk to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Well, okay. It might be fun to play against someone for a change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "Thank you! I'm in your debt!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "This is Kiryu-san. He will be playing with you today, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"Excellent! Please, call me Kurosawa. Go easy on me, okay?\r\n"
"Har har har."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"(Kiryu-san, please beat the president for me. It'll be a good lesson for him"
" if he loses.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"(I'll be sure to give you a reward if you can knock his tee down a few "
"holes, if you know what I mean. Heheh.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"I'm tired of playing with you. I want to play someone who's actually good at"
" golf."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"As you wish, sir. I sincerely apologize. I will find you a more suitable "
"opponent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"Can you find one soon? Today's my golf day. It would be a shame if you "
"weren't able to find someone in time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"I hope there's somebody around. I'm not asking you to find a professional "
"golfer, but I'd like to play with someone of that caliber."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "As you wish, sir. Now, who can I find...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"Excuse me. I'm sorry to bother you, sir, but are you here to play golf "
"today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "Già..."

msgctxt "552"
msgid ""
"I apologize for not introducing myself. My name\r\n"
"is Tamura. I work for a fish processing company."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "I'm Kiryu."
msgstr "Sono Kiryu."

msgctxt "576"
msgid ""
"I don't mean to put you on the spot, but would you be willing to play a "
"round of golf with our president?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid ""
"(To be honest, he is tired of playing golf with a novice like me. He asked "
"me to find him somebody with the skill level of a pro.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"(So, will you play with our president? I'll be sure to make it worth your "
"while.)"
msgstr ""

